WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
News is not the most important thing to me, so what do you want?

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:04,040
Don’t let one person hold all the resources

3
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:05,880
But what if Zhang Feifei also becomes the second Xue Ya?

4
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:06,880
That's for the future

5
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,800
Now at least let the fire naughty food

6
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,880
It's not just in the hands of one person. Who wants to be the boss?

7
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:12,160
You have to exchange the real thing.

8
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,160
rather than threats

9
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:14,320
You didn't join us at all

10
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:16,400
He can see our thoughts quite clearly.

11
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,720
Because I don’t need a team

12
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:19,680
So see it more clearly

13
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:21,080
Xue Ya relies on lighter to control fire

14
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,720
Zhang Feifei didn’t dare to turn against him

15
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:24,720
You can tell Zhang Feifei how to burn peaches.

16
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:26,280
But don’t let Xue Ya’s family monopolize it

17
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,920
Do you want them to keep each other in check?

18
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:30,120
A team of more than a dozen people who are unified yet hostile to me

19
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:35,450
It’s much more troublesome than a few small teams that are mutually exclusive. I understand.

20
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:36,850
I'll let Xue Ya take a look tomorrow

21
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:38,850
I can still do things without her little command.
